WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.233 --> 00:00:04.800
Ta-da!

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.500
Hi, it's N-ko!

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:10.600
This week's The N-ko Show has started!

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:13.866
It has become more humid lately.

00:00:13.866 --> 00:00:17.600
As you can see, I have lots of hair,

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:20.566
so it gives me a lot of trouble when it's humid.

00:00:20.566 --> 00:00:23.966
I hope summer will come soon.

00:00:23.966 --> 00:00:27.833
By the way, I bought an Apple Watch recently.

00:00:27.833 --> 00:00:31.766
It measures my workout time and sleeping time,

00:00:31.766 --> 00:00:35.466
I can take a train just by tapping my watch,

00:00:35.466 --> 00:00:37.833
and buy a drink at a convenience store.

00:00:37.833 --> 00:00:40.366
The world really has become convenient.

00:00:40.366 --> 00:00:44.566
I feel like I've become the protagonist of a sci-fi anime.

00:00:44.566 --> 00:00:47.866
So I love it a lot.

00:00:47.866 --> 00:00:49.366
Everyone,

00:00:49.366 --> 00:00:52.100
please do some shopping

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:54.233
and blow away the humid air!

00:00:54.233 --> 00:00:58.833
Well then, let's start this week's The N-ko Show!

00:00:59.633 --> 00:01:02.033
Weekly Favorites!

00:01:03.166 --> 00:01:07.900
I will share my recommendations based on my personal preference again.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.533
This is the theme.

00:01:10.133 --> 00:01:12.400
It's dangerous to watch late at night?

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:16.566
Anime with delicious-looking dishes that are sure to make you hungry!

00:01:16.966 --> 00:01:22.633
Dishes that appear in anime look really delicious.

00:01:22.633 --> 00:01:26.100
Some of them are dishes you can eat in the real world,

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:29.233
and some are unknown dishes in a fantasy world.

00:01:29.233 --> 00:01:34.766
The various dishes will stimulate your dream and appetite.

00:01:34.766 --> 00:01:39.366
This time, I'll introduce anime that features dishes

00:01:39.366 --> 00:01:46.133
that especially impressed me, among the attractive "anime dishes."

00:01:46.133 --> 00:01:47.766
Here is the first one.

00:01:47.766 --> 00:01:49.900
DRIFTING DRAGONS.

00:01:49.900 --> 00:01:53.300
In a world where the creature called dragons live,

00:01:53.633 --> 00:01:57.066
a group of drakers hunt dragons and travel in the sky.

00:01:57.066 --> 00:02:02.200
This anime depicts the story of the drakers.

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:05.666
Mika, the protagonist, loves eating dragon meat.

00:02:05.666 --> 00:02:07.966
So in the anime,

00:02:07.966 --> 00:02:11.166
various dragon dishes Mika likes are featured.

00:02:11.166 --> 00:02:14.300
Like Dragon Tail Meat Sandwich,

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:16.766
and Pressed Dragon Treinne.

00:02:16.766 --> 00:02:20.933
There are many dishes made with dragon meat,

00:02:20.933 --> 00:02:25.133
and every single one of them looks really delicious.

00:02:25.133 --> 00:02:27.700
It uses food ingredients in a fantasy world

00:02:27.700 --> 00:02:31.700
to make dishes close to the real world.

00:02:31.700 --> 00:02:36.233
Seeing that, I can somehow imagine the taste with its seasonings,

00:02:36.233 --> 00:02:41.233
but it makes me very curious about what dragon meat tastes like.

00:02:41.233 --> 00:02:44.166
Next, it is this anime.

00:02:44.166 --> 00:02:45.166
BAKI.

00:02:45.166 --> 00:02:48.900
To surpass his father, Yujiro Hanma, who is celebrated as

00:02:48.900 --> 00:02:51.333
the strongest creature on Earth,

00:02:51.333 --> 00:02:56.000
Baki received various training and fought against many martial artists.

00:02:56.000 --> 00:03:00.266
This anime depicts the growth of the protagonist Baki Hanma.

00:03:00.266 --> 00:03:02.833
There are many highlights in BAKI,

00:03:02.833 --> 00:03:06.500
like its memorable lines and techniques.

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:11.066
But actually, the scenes of food are also very impressive!

00:03:11.066 --> 00:03:13.466
What stays in my memory most

00:03:13.466 --> 00:03:19.000
is a scene where Baki Hanma was poisoned by his opponent and was dying.

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:23.000
His rival and friend, Sea King Retsu,

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:29.733
prepared nourishing dishes to detoxify and help him recover.

00:03:29.733 --> 00:03:35.066
The many Chinese dishes look delicious, seeing Baki eating them all at once

00:03:35.066 --> 00:03:38.400
really stimulated my appetite.

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:42.133
He drank a large amount of water for dessert at the end,

00:03:42.133 --> 00:03:45.133
it was so much that it looked tormenting.

00:03:45.133 --> 00:03:46.766
So I don't think I can drink that,

00:03:47.033 --> 00:03:50.200
but the Chinese dishes prepared by Sea King Retsu

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:52.566
are something I do want to try.

00:03:52.566 --> 00:03:55.833
Also, there are scenes where he eats a thick piece of steak,

00:03:55.833 --> 00:03:58.733
and enjoys a delicious breakfast.

00:03:58.733 --> 00:04:04.066
So I personally think BAKI is an anime with a strong food element.

00:04:04.066 --> 00:04:08.033
When dishes we're familiar with in our daily life are featured,

00:04:08.033 --> 00:04:11.000
it's rather easy to eat them,

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:15.533
so it's fun to enjoy them while thinking about the anime.

00:04:15.533 --> 00:04:17.166
This is the last one.

00:04:17.166 --> 00:04:18.233
LAID-BACK CAMP.

00:04:18.233 --> 00:04:23.366
This anime features some high school girls leisure camping.

00:04:23.366 --> 00:04:25.933
Besides elements of camping,

00:04:25.933 --> 00:04:30.166
there are various dishes they eat during camping,

00:04:30.166 --> 00:04:33.066
which we must mention when we talk about the anime.

00:04:33.066 --> 00:04:37.733
Many LAID-BACK CAMP fans must've tried s'mores.

00:04:37.733 --> 00:04:42.700
I've been eating s'mores since I was little and I love it.

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:44.800
Because they're cooking outdoors,

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:47.833
utensils and food ingredients are limited,

00:04:47.833 --> 00:04:51.033
so the Japanese girls cook various dishes

00:04:51.033 --> 00:04:54.100
using creativity, effort, and passion.

00:04:54.433 --> 00:04:56.333
Even if it's simple at a glance,

00:04:56.333 --> 00:05:01.466
cooking and eating outdoors makes a dish more delicious.

00:05:01.466 --> 00:05:04.333
This anime makes me jealous.

00:05:04.333 --> 00:05:08.433
There's a dish in the anime I'd like to try,

00:05:08.433 --> 00:05:10.200
and it's pasta soup.

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:13.966
At the simplest and coldest camping site,

00:05:13.966 --> 00:05:19.066
I can imagine its mild flavor warming up my body and heart!

00:05:19.066 --> 00:05:22.066
When I have time, I want to go camping

00:05:22.266 --> 00:05:28.133
and eat some delicious dishes in a large open space too.

00:05:28.133 --> 00:05:30.766
All dishes in the anime I introduced today

00:05:30.766 --> 00:05:35.066
will make you starve if you watch the anime late at night,

00:05:35.066 --> 00:05:38.200
so pay attention to when you watch them.

00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:41.400
That's it for Weekly Favorites.

00:05:42.533 --> 00:05:44.100
N-ko English.

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:50.466
In this segment, I will share how to say anime quotes in English.

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:54.433
This time, I'll share an anime quote you'll want to use

00:05:54.433 --> 00:05:57.033
when you get the chance.

00:05:57.033 --> 00:05:59.233
Well then, let's begin.

00:05:59.233 --> 00:06:01.533
This is today's quotation.

00:06:02.533 --> 00:06:05.866
"Catch it properly, eat it properly."

00:06:06.700 --> 00:06:09.366
Catch it properly, eat it properly.

00:06:10.166 --> 00:06:12.400
This is what Mika,

00:06:12.400 --> 00:06:17.100
protagonist of DRIFTING DRAGONS, said when she fought against a dragon.

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:22.466
The way Mika faces dragons is summarized in this quote,

00:06:22.466 --> 00:06:25.100
so I think many people like it.

00:06:25.100 --> 00:06:29.200
Do practice it till you can say it anytime you want.

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:31.533
A little tip on pronunciation.

00:06:31.533 --> 00:06:38.366
Put an emphasis on "properly."

00:06:38.366 --> 00:06:39.466
Properly.

00:06:39.466 --> 00:06:41.400
Pro-perly.

00:06:41.733 --> 00:06:43.266
It's how you pronounce it.

00:06:43.266 --> 00:06:45.866
When you go fishing with your friend...

00:06:47.666 --> 00:06:52.166
If you say this when you can't catch the fish the way you want,

00:06:52.166 --> 00:06:57.433
no doubt your friend will think that you're cool!

00:06:57.600 --> 00:07:00.633
Please use this quote.

00:07:01.333 --> 00:07:04.466
That's it for N-ko English.

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:08.733
N-ko's Q &amp; A.

00:07:08.733 --> 00:07:13.500
I will answer your questions again this week.

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:15.866
Let's start.

00:07:15.866 --> 00:07:17.700
This is the first question.

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:21.666
"Is there any YouTuber you like now?"

00:07:25.233 --> 00:07:28.866
Let me think... There is one I've liked for a while,

00:07:28.866 --> 00:07:31.266
it's someone called Liziqi.

00:07:31.966 --> 00:07:37.000
I think she has 15.2 million subscribers,

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:41.333
and she is a very popular Chinese YouTuber.

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:44.066
She lives in the countryside,

00:07:44.066 --> 00:07:47.533
in a mountain that looks like old-time China.

00:07:47.866 --> 00:07:52.633
She harvests various kinds of food from her garden,

00:07:52.633 --> 00:07:57.966
and makes her own bedding from cotton.

00:07:57.966 --> 00:07:59.633
She's really amazing.

00:07:59.900 --> 00:08:01.600
Please go and have a look.

00:08:01.600 --> 00:08:05.100
The videos are gorgeous too, and therapeutic to watch.

00:08:05.100 --> 00:08:08.933
"What is the national anime of America?"

00:08:09.166 --> 00:08:10.866
Let me think...

00:08:10.866 --> 00:08:15.900
Generally speaking, it probably is TOM AND JERRY,

00:08:15.900 --> 00:08:19.233
it's the first one that comes to mind.

00:08:19.233 --> 00:08:23.566
Or SNOOPY. To people of my generation,

00:08:23.566 --> 00:08:29.133
I think SPONGEBOB counts as the national anime.

00:08:29.133 --> 00:08:31.900
"Who is the character you want to try cosplaying?"

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:37.300
I want to cosplay a character who wears flamboyant costumes.

00:08:37.300 --> 00:08:42.200
But my hair is white,

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:45.066
so I'll choose a character who also has white hair.

00:08:45.066 --> 00:08:49.700
I would like to cosplay INUYASHA's Sesshomaru.

00:08:49.700 --> 00:08:53.600
"Is there any dish you like at your staff canteen?"

00:08:53.600 --> 00:08:58.200
I order takeaway every time at Netflix,

00:08:58.200 --> 00:09:02.466
so it isn't like at our staff canteen.

00:09:02.466 --> 00:09:07.466
But I always have pad thai when Thai cuisine is served.

00:09:07.466 --> 00:09:09.000
"If it's allowed,

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:12.533
please tell us something only Netflix employees know."

00:09:12.533 --> 00:09:18.200
We name all our meeting rooms with names of anime.

00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:19.500
So we talk like,

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:26.100
"Today's meeting will be held at DEVILMAN CRYBABY,"

00:09:26.100 --> 00:09:30.033
or, "There are many windows in RILAKKUMA AND KAORU's room,

00:09:30.033 --> 00:09:31.733
and it's very comfortable."

00:09:31.733 --> 00:09:36.833
It's the daily conversation between our employees.

00:09:36.833 --> 00:09:40.933
Thank you for your many questions today as well!

00:09:41.533 --> 00:09:45.866
I'm still waiting for you to send me your questions!

00:09:45.866 --> 00:09:49.133
That's it for N-ko's Q &amp; A.

00:09:50.533 --> 00:09:56.000
The N-ko Show! It's now time to say goodbye.

00:09:56.000 --> 00:10:02.233
This time, I introduced many anime that will make you hungry,

00:10:02.233 --> 00:10:06.933
so tonight, I'll make some personal effort to cook.

00:10:06.933 --> 00:10:08.600
Until next week,

00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:13.433
I'm going to watch the season two of LOVE, DEATH &amp; ROBOTS!

00:10:13.433 --> 00:10:16.066
Let's meet again next time!

00:10:16.066 --> 00:10:18.100
See you!

